[[This is a writer's note about the scene]]

INT. THE CORE - DAY

Kael and Mira stand before the terminal. Elena's ghost flickers.

ELENA
You were never meant to escape.

MIRA
Then why show us the door?

ELENA
Because the door was always open.

                SMASH CUT TO:

EXT. THE INSTITUTE - DAY

The building crumbles. The children emerge into the real world.

                FADE OUT.
